<title>CROATIA: Croatia c. bank sells HRK234 mln bills, rates flat.</title>
<headline>Croatia c. bank sells HRK234 mln bills, rates flat.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Croatia's central bank sold 234 million kuna in 35- and 91-day liquidity bills at flat rates on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The volume shrank from 255.5 million kuna sold last week while the rates held at 7.0 and 8.0 percent respectively.</p>
<p>But the central bank said the net volume increased by 53 million kuna as 181 million in bills matured today.</p>
<p>-- Zoran Radosavljevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
